## Published Convenience Images

The optional `python-office` image stack contains no Motet code. It
aggregates unmodified Debian packages including copyleft components
(Ghostscript AGPL-3.0, Poppler GPL-2.0, pandoc GPL-2.0+, LibreOffice
MPL-2.0). The image bakes third-party notices and full package manifests
under /usr/share/motet/; corresponding Debian source is available from
https://snapshot.debian.org/. See docker/images/python-office/NOTICES.

## Optional Native Codecs

AVIF conversion uses Pillow's native libavif/dav1d support when
`MOTET_ENABLE_AVIF_CONVERSION=1`. Default images do not include `pillow-heif`.
HEIC/HEIF conversion stays off unless an operator installs `pillow-heif` and
sets `MOTET_ENABLE_HEIC_HEIF_CONVERSION=1`. Official pillow-heif wheels vendor
HEVC codecs under GPL/LGPL; review those licenses before enabling HEIC.
See motet/core/media/README.md.

